# Careers in Cyber

## Overview

This room introduces the different career paths in cybersecurity and explains the roles, responsibilities, and skills required for each position.

## Objectives

- Explore different cybersecurity career paths.
- Understand the responsibilities of various security roles.
- Identify the skills needed to start a career in cybersecurity.

## Skills Learned

- Cybersecurity career awareness
- Understanding security roles
- Offensive and Defensive Security concepts
- Career path planning

## Key Takeaways

- Cybersecurity offers many different career paths, from offensive security to defensive security.
- Each role requires different technical skills and knowledge.
- Understanding different roles helps in choosing the right learning path.

## Reflection

This room helped me understand the variety of careers available in cybersecurity.
While there are many interesting roles, I found myself more interested in offensive security and penetration testing.
Learning about different career paths helped me better define my future direction in cybersecurity.

